# Core Android-app-compatibility layer. This is the feature that
# differentiates LuxenOS: Waydroid runs real Android apps as first-class
# windows on the Sway desktop. Waydroid itself is installed by
# config/hooks/live/0100-install-waydroid.hook.chroot (it ships from its
# own upstream apt repo, added at build time, not from Debian's archive),
# so this list only covers what that hook needs available beforehand.
curl
ca-certificates
lxc
python3
dbus-user-session
